"body": "The fight for Pywel begins March 19, 2026.\nPre-orders for Crimson Desert are now available on PlayStation 5, Xbox Series X|S, Steam, and Mac! Don’t miss out on the exclusive Khaled Shield pre-order bonus and the PlayStation-exclusive Grotevant Plate Set.\nTemplate BTN - Dark With Img Start [alt 수정 필요 ![](https://s1.pearlcdn.com/cd/brand/contents_cd/img/crimsondesert/sns_ps5.png) SEO에 노출될 텍스트 수정 필요 PS5](https://store.playstation.com/concept/10002363/) Template BTN - Dark With Img End [![](https://s1.pearlcdn.com/cd/brand/contents_cd/img/crimsondesert/sns_steam.png) SEO에 노출될 텍스트 수정 필요 STEAM](https://store.steampowered.com/app/3321460?utm_source=official&utm_campaign=cd&utm_medium=en&utm_content=web&utm_term=web) Template BTN - Dark With Img End [![](https://s1.pearlcdn.com/cd/brand/contents_cd/img/crimsondesert/sns_xbox.png) SEO에 노출될 텍스트 수정 필요 XBOX SERIES X|S](https://www.xbox.com/games/store/crimsondesert/9NG592G0W474) Template BTN - Dark With Img End [![](https://s1.pearlcdn.com/cd/brand/board/2025/11/04/8a1fba1aa1d20251104053643550.png) SEO에 노출될 텍스트 수정 필요 MAC](https://crimsondesert.pearlabyss.com/) Template BTN - Dark With Img End\n\n| **Europe** | **North America** | **Asia** |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| March 19th, 2026 (Thu) at 22:00 (UTC) March 19th, 2026 (Thu) at 23:00 (CET) | March 19th, 2026 (Thu) at 15:00 (PT) March 19th, 2026 (Thu) at 18:00 (ET) | March 20th, 2026 (Fri) at 07:00 (KST / JST) |\n\nCheck out the different Digital and Physical Editions below.\nTemplate BTN - Big Parchment Start [버튼 배경 이미지 ![](https://s1.pearlcdn.com/cd/brand/contents_cd/img/main/btn_main.png) Crimson Desert Game Editions](https://crimsondesert.pearlabyss.com/Main#preorder)\nThank you for the unwavering support you have shown for Crimson Desert – from the moment of the game’s first announcement until now. Now, get ready for your journey and let a new chapter of this land’s history begin.\nCrimson Desert’s Release Date Reveal Trailer made its world premiere on September 24, 2025 during State of Play. Check out the video and get a new glimpse into the story of Kliff and the Greymanes."
