"title": "TOKYO GAME SHOW 2025 Participation Announcement",
"utc": "2025-08-27T01:30:00Z",
"body": "Crimson Desert is coming to TOKYO GAME SHOW 2025!\nJoin Pearl Abyss at TOKYO GAME SHOW 2025 and play Crimson Desert in the first hands-on demonstration booth held in Japan!\nPlay as Kliff, who arrives on the battlefields of Calphade in search of one of his Greymane comrades, on one of the 100 demonstration stations that will be available on-site.\nWe hope to see you there!\n\n### ■ TOKYO GAME SHOW 2025 Details\n\n![](https://s1.pearlcdn.com/cd/brand/board/2025/08/27/2503564655320250827005444614.png)\n■ Schedule\n- September 25, 2025 (Thur) - September 28, 2025 (Sun)\n■ Crimson Desert TOKYO GAME SHOW 2025 Booth Info\n- Location: Makuhari Messe convention center (Chiba Prefecture, Chiba City, Japan)\n- Booth: Hall 6 S6-S01\n[![](https://s1.pearlcdn.com/cd/brand/board/2025/04/11/068f4a087d820250411070404147.png)](https://store.steampowered.com/app/3321460?utm_source=official_notice&utm_campaign=tga&utm_medium=gl&utm_content=notice&utm_term=notice)\n\n### ● Join us on:\n\n» [https://youtube.com/crimsondesert](https://youtube.com/crimsondesert)\n» [https://x.com/crimsondesert_](https://x.com/crimsondesert_)\n» [https://instagram.com/crimsondesert_](https://instagram.com/crimsondesert_)\n» [https://facebook.com/crimsondesert](https://facebook.com/crimsondesert)\n» [https://discord.gg/crimsondesert](https://discord.gg/crimsondesert)"
