"title": "Join Crimson Desert at PAX East 2025",
"utc": "2025-04-15T14:00:00Z",
"body": "Crimson Desert is heading over to Boston for PAX East 2025!\nFrom May 8th to 11th at the Boston Convention & Exhibition Center, join Kliff in his battles at Crimson Desert’s first hands-on booth in North America.\nTo those who plan on attending, we can’t wait to meet you and have you take up the sword and shield of the lone mercenary. See you there!\n\n## PAX East 2025 Schedule\n\n- Thu, May 8 - Sun, May 11, 2025 10AM - 6PM (EST)\n- Location: Boston Convention & Exhibition Center\n- Crimson Desert Booth Location: Booth 16019\n![](https://s1.pearlcdn.com/cd/brand/board/2025/04/16/7cfa98e0e0520250416063305545.jpg)\n![](https://s1.pearlcdn.com/cd/brand/board/2025/04/15/ac9b806a23620250415083922463.png)\n[![](https://s1.pearlcdn.com/cd/brand/board/2025/04/11/068f4a087d820250411070404147.png)](https://store.steampowered.com/app/3321460?utm_source=official_notice&utm_campaign=tga&utm_medium=gl&utm_content=notice&utm_term=notice)\n\n### ● Join us on:\n\n» [https://youtube.com/crimsondesert](https://youtube.com/crimsondesert)\n» [https://x.com/crimsondesert_](https://x.com/crimsondesert_)\n» [https://instagram.com/crimsondesert_](https://instagram.com/crimsondesert_)\n» [https://facebook.com/crimsondesert](https://facebook.com/crimsondesert)\n» [https://discord.gg/crimsondesert](https://discord.gg/crimsondesert)"
