"cat": "공지사항",
"title": "Crimson Desert Gameplay Trailer (gamescom ONL 2023)",
"utc": "2023-08-22T00:00:00Z",
"body": "We are excited to share with you the latest Crimson Desert gameplay trailer which premiered at gamescom Opening Night Live 2023.\nStep back into the breathtaking world of Crimson Desert and join the lone mercenary as he navigates both the stunning beauty and cutthroat dangers of Pywel, the war-torn continent where history will be written in blood.\n● Join us on:\n» YouTube: [https://youtube.com/crimsondesert](https://youtube.com/crimsondesert)\n» Twitter: [https://twitter.com/crimsondesert_](https://twitter.com/crimsondesert_)\n» Discord: [https://discord.gg/crimsondesert](https://discord.gg/crimsondesert)\n» Facebook: [https://facebook.com/crimsondesert](https://facebook.com/crimsondesert)\n» Instagram: [https://instagram.com/crimsondesert_](https://instagram.com/crimsondesert_)"
