"body": "Get an insider's look into the recently revealed Crimson Desert gameplay trailer and learn more about the world of Pywel, the philosophy behind the game's combat system, and the game's main character in this Dev Archives: Game Overview video.\nThis Dev Archives video features behind-the-scenes talks from Daeil Kim, the Executive Producer of Crimson Desert, Co-producers HwanKyoung Jung and SeongWoo Lee, and Lead Combat Designer Hyoseok Chae.\n\n### ● Join us on:\n\n» YouTube: [https://youtube.com/crimsondesert](https://www.youtube.com/crimsondesert)\n» Twitter: [https://twitter.com/crimsondesert_](https://www.twitter.com/crimsondesert_)\n» Discord: [https://discord.gg/crimsondesert](https://discord.gg/crimsondesert)\n» Facebook: [https://facebook.com/crimsondesert](https://www.facebook.com/crimsondesert)\n» Instagram: [https://instagram.com/crimsondesert_](https://instagram.com/crimsondesert_)"
